# Untracked working files, which the handoff and doc-review commands write to the repository root.
# They are scratch rather than documentation, and a local `markdownlint --fix` run would otherwise
# rewrite them.
#
# The leading slash anchors each pattern to the repository root, so `/local-review*.md` matches only
# the working file a command writes there — not, say, a future `docs/local-review-guide.md`.
/*DOC-REVIEW.md
/*HANDOFF.md
/*PLAN.md
/local-review*.md
